{title: The Law Of God Is Good And Wise}
{artist: Matthias Loy}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 120}

Verse 1
[Em]The law of God is [Am]good and wise, And [Bm]sets
His will before our [Am]eyes, Shows us the way [Em]of right
eousness, And [B]dooms to death when we [Em]transgress.

Verse 2
Its light of holiness [C]imparts The know
ledge of [Am]our sinful hearts, That [D]we may see our lost
[G]estate And seek deliv'rance ere [C]too late.

Verse 3
To those [Am]who help in Christ have [D]found And would
in works [G]of love abound It [C]shows what deeds are His
[G]delight And should be done [D]as good and right.

Verse 4
[Em]When men the offered help [Am]disdain And will
fully in [D]sin remain, Its terror [G]in their ear
resounds And [C]keeps their wickedness in bounds.

Verse 5
[Am]The law is good, but [G]since the fall Its [D]ho
liness condemns us all; [Em]It dooms us for our [B]sin
to die And [Em]has no pow'r to justify.
